(PREFACE.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(It is now exactly twenty-five years since was published my first book) Tj T*
(upon the large topics at present in hand. It was but as a bow drawn at) Tj T*
(a venture, and was very properly entitled "Elements of Political) Tj T*
(Economy." At that time I had been teaching for about a dozen years in) Tj T*
(this Institution the closely cognate subjects of History and Political) Tj T*
(Economy; cognate indeed, since Hermann Lotze, a distinguished German) Tj T*
(philosopher of our day, makes prominent among its only _five_ most) Tj T*
(general phases, the "industrial" element in all human history; and) Tj T*
(since Goldwin Smith, an able English scholar, resolves the elements of) Tj T*
(human progress, and thus of universal history, into only _three_,) Tj T*
(namely, "the moral, the intellectual, and the productive.") Tj T*
() Tj T*
(During these studious and observant years of teaching, I had slowly) Tj T*
(come to a settled conviction that I could say something of my own and) Tj T*
(something of consequence about Political Economy, especially at two) Tj T*
(points; and these two proved in the sequel to be more radical and) Tj T*
(transforming points than was even thought of at the first. For one) Tj T*
(thing, I had satisfied myself, that the word "Wealth," as at once a) Tj T*
(strangely indefinite and grossly misleading term, was worse than) Tj T*
(useless in the nomenclature of the Science, and would have to be) Tj T*
(utterly dislodged from it, before a scientific content and defensible) Tj T*
(form could by any possibility be given to what had long been called in) Tj T*
(all the modern languages the "Science of Wealth." Accordingly, so far) Tj T*
(as has appeared in the long interval of time since 1865, these) Tj T*
("Elements" were the very first attempt to undertake an orderly) Tj T*
(construction of Economics from beginning to end without once using or) Tj T*
(having occasion to use the obnoxious word. A scientific substitute for) Tj T*
(it was of course required, which, with the help of Bastiat, himself) Tj T*
(however still clinging to the technical term "Richesse," was discerned) Tj T*
(and appropriated in the word "Value"; a good word indeed, that can be) Tj T*
(simply and perfectly defined in a scientific sense of its own; and,) Tj T*
(what is more important still, that precisely covers in that sense all) Tj T*
(the three sorts of things which are ever bought and sold, the three) Tj T*
(only Valuables in short, namely, material Commodities, personal) Tj T*
(Services, commercial Credits. It is of course involved in this) Tj T*
(simple-looking but far-reaching change from "Wealth" to "Value," that) Tj T*
(Economics become at once and throughout a science of Persons buying) Tj T*
ET
