(assistance to me from the first in studying Political Economy, a fresh) Tj T*
(book written expressly for them and for others like-circumstanced; in) Tj T*
(which every principle is drawn from the facts of every-day life by way) Tj T*
(of induction, and also stands in vital touch with such facts \(past or) Tj T*
(present\) by way of illustration.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The third and only other reason needful to be mentioned here is, that) Tj T*
(in recent years the legislation of my country in the matter of cheap) Tj T*
(Money and of artificial restrictions on Trade has run so directly) Tj T*
(counter to sound Economics in their very core, that I felt it a debt) Tj T*
(due to my countrymen to use once more the best and ripest results of) Tj T*
(my life-long studies, in the most cogent and persuasive way possible) Tj T*
(within strictly scientific limits, to help them see and act for) Tj T*
(themselves in the way of escape from false counsels and impoverishing) Tj T*
(statutes. Wantonly and enormously heavy lies the hand of the national) Tj T*
(Government upon the masses of the people at present. But the People) Tj T*
(are sovereign, and not their transient agents in the government; and) Tj T*
(the signs are now cheering indeed, that they have not forgotten their) Tj T*
(native word of command, nor that government is instituted for the) Tj T*
(sole benefit of the governed and governing people, nor that the) Tj T*
(greatest good of the greatest number is the true aim and guide of) Tj T*
(Legislation. I am grateful for the proofs that appear on every hand,) Tj T*
(that former labors in these directions and under these motives have) Tj T*
(proven themselves to have been both opportune and effective; and I am) Tj T*
(sanguine almost to certainty, that this reiterated effort undertaken) Tj T*
(for the sake of my fellow-citizens as a whole, will slowly bear) Tj T*
(abundant fruit also, as towards their liberty of action as) Tj T*
(individuals, and in their harmonious co-operation together as entire) Tj T*
(classes to the end of popular comforts and universal progress.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(                                                A. L. PERRY.) Tj T*
