() Tj T*
(The first question that confronts the beginner in this science, and) Tj T*
(the one also that controls the whole scope of his inquiries to the) Tj T*
(very end, is: What is the precise subject of Political Economy? Within) Tj T*
(what exact field do its investigations lie? There is indeed a short) Tj T*
(and broad and full answer at hand to this fundamental and) Tj T*
(comprehensive question; and yet it is every way better for all) Tj T*
(concerned to reach this answer by a route somewhat delayed and) Tj T*
(circuitous, just as it is better in ascending a mountain summit for) Tj T*
(the sake of a strong and complete view to circle up leisurely on foot) Tj T*
(or on horseback, rather than to dash straight up to the top by a) Tj T*
(cog-wheel railway and take all of a sudden what might prove to be a) Tj T*
(less impressive or a more confusing view.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The preliminary questions are: What sort of facts has Political) Tj T*
(Economy to deal with, to inquire into, to classify, to make a science) Tj T*
(of? Are these facts easily separable in the mind and in reality from) Tj T*
(other kinds of facts perhaps liable to be confounded with them? Are) Tj T*
(they facts of vast importance to the welfare of mankind? And are the) Tj T*
(activities of men everywhere greatly and increasingly occupied with) Tj T*
(just those things, with which this science has exclusively to do? Let) Tj T*
(us see if we cannot come little by little by a route of our own to) Tj T*
(clear and true answers for all these questions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(If one should take his stand for an hour upon London Bridge, perhaps) Tj T*
(the busiest bit of street in the world, and cast his eyes around) Tj T*
(intelligently to see what he can see, and begin also to classify the) Tj T*
