(every man to buy and sell and get gain is just as fully a right as the) Tj T*
(right of breathing. It stands on the same impregnable ground. It is a) Tj T*
(natural and self-evident and inalienable right, with which each man) Tj T*
(has been endowed by his Creator, to put forth efforts for his own) Tj T*
(well-being and for those dependent upon him, either directly or by) Tj T*
(means of efforts exchanged with other men equally free; and he is a) Tj T*
