(There are three kinds of things only ever bought and sold in this good) Tj T*
(world of ours. In the preceding chapter we have conned carefully the) Tj T*
(first kind, material commodities, in their three subdivisions of) Tj T*
(land-parcels and products of such parcels and products of free land) Tj T*
(and sea. In the present chapter we come to study the second kind of) Tj T*
(valuable things, personal services, which we shall also find) Tj T*
(subdivisible into three classes. We have treated of Commodities first,) Tj T*
(because their value in its grounds and changes is more easily) Tj T*
(understood than that of the other two kinds, while in point of _time_) Tj T*
(Services might well enough have been considered first, since it is) Tj T*
(these that manipulate into value the originally rude forms of Nature.) Tj T*
(The main difference between the two is this: in Commodities the) Tj T*
(attention is naturally drawn to tangible _things_ offered for sale,) Tj T*
(such as lands and wheat and fish; while in Services the attention is) Tj T*
(strongly drawn to _persons_ offering them for sale, such as the common) Tj T*
(laborer and the skilled artisan and the professional artist. This) Tj T*
(distinction, though obvious and useful as between commodities and) Tj T*
(services, is not after all radical; because Economics is a science of) Tj T*
(Persons from beginning to end; inasmuch as the services precede and) Tj T*
(are merged in the commodities, and inasmuch as the Desires \(personal\)) Tj T*
(of some men for the renderings of other men antedate and underlie all) Tj T*
(exchanges whatsoever.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Personal Services are technically named _Labor_ in the science of) Tj T*
(Political Economy. This nomenclature is old and familiar, and will) Tj T*
(probably always persist on that account, but it is not of itself of) Tj T*
(the happiest, and it gives birth to some ambiguities and many) Tj T*
(fallacies. Let us look at these for a moment, before we pass to the) Tj T*
(definition and discussion of what is commonly called Labor, but what) Tj T*
(is better described by the term, Personal Services.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
