(corresponding rise in the price of food, rudely disturbed the course) Tj T*
(of industrial employments; harvests rotted on the ground, and fields) Tj T*
(were left untilled, not merely from scarcity of hands, but from the) Tj T*
(strife which now for the first time revealed itself between Capital) Tj T*
(and Labor" \(Green\). The landowners of the country districts, and the) Tj T*
(craftsmen of the towns, not understanding the law of Wages as an) Tj T*
(invariable resultant of the Demand and Supply of laborers, were) Tj T*
(scandalized by what seemed to them the extravagant demands of the new) Tj T*
(labor-class. Parliament equally ignorant with the People of the) Tj T*
(natural economic law, enacted as follows: "_Every man or woman of) Tj T*
(whatsoever condition, free or bond, able in body, and within the age) Tj T*
(of threescore years, and not having of his own whereof he may live,) Tj T*
(nor land of his own about the tillage of which he may occupy himself,) Tj T*
(and not serving any other, shall be bound to serve the employer who) Tj T*
(shall require him to do so, and shall take only the wages which were) Tj T*
(accustomed to be taken in the neighborhood where he is bound to serve) Tj T*
(two years before the plague began._" Afterwards, the runaway laborer) Tj T*
(was ordered by Parliamentary enactment to be branded in the forehead) Tj T*
(by a hot iron, and the harboring of the country serfs in the towns, in) Tj T*
(which under their civic rules a serf keeping himself a year and a day) Tj T*
(was thereafter free, was rigorously forbidden. These acts of) Tj T*
(Parliament, and many more of the same kind, were powerless to keep) Tj T*
(down wages to the old standard, but were powerful to keep up ill-blood) Tj T*
