(the labor being the same at the two points of time, then the) Tj T*
(conclusion is inevitable, that the _cost of the capital_ at the second) Tj T*
(point is less than it was at the first point. With this conclusion all) Tj T*
(facts agree. All the laborers connected with a railroad from highest) Tj T*
