(became very rich. "A common fund was raised by contributions among the) Tj T*
(members, which not only provided for the trade objects of the guild;) Tj T*
(but sufficed to found chantries and masses, and set up painted windows) Tj T*
(in the church of their patron saint. Even at the present day the arms) Tj T*
(of the craft-guild may often be seen blazoned in cathedrals side by) Tj T*
(side with those of prelates and kings." This radical difference) Tj T*
(between the two must always be borne in mind in all arguments and) Tj T*
(inferences drawn over from the mediæval "unions" to those of the) Tj T*
(present day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Two points may be freely conceded to these labor-organizations before) Tj T*
(we pass to the economic objections to them. In the first place, the) Tj T*
(employers _set the example_ for the employees in a tacit if not open) Tj T*
(combination as against the employees in their own interest and) Tj T*
(emolument. The so-called "protective" tariff, for instance, is nothing) Tj T*
(in the world but a strongly-linked combination of certain rich) Tj T*
(capitalists to extort from the masses \(their own laborers included\)) Tj T*
(artificially lifted prices for the necessaries of life; and the) Tj T*
(certain result of shutting out imports by tariff-taxes is the) Tj T*
(shutting in of would-be exports, to the certain lowering of general) Tj T*
(wages in a country, because there is a lessened demand for laborers in) Tj T*
(consequence. For a second good instance of combinations as against) Tj T*
(employees on the part of employers, take the well-known understanding) Tj T*
(among manufacturers of the same sort of goods in the same general) Tj T*
(locality, that laborers discharged from one establishment shall not be) Tj T*
(hired in any of the rest; and that if the general voice call for a) Tj T*
("shut down," or for three-fourths time or less, all in that line of) Tj T*
(goods shall comply. How can laborers be blamed for organizations in) Tj T*
(their own behalf when they find themselves confronted as individuals) Tj T*
(with an organization of employers?) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Then, too, it must be acknowledged, that, had it not been for united) Tj T*
(action of some sort on the part of the laborers, the unreasonable) Tj T*
(hours of fifty years ago in mills and factories would probably not) Tj T*
(have been shortened to this day. Capitalists as a class are) Tj T*
(conservative of methods, as well as of ends. The cotton and woollen) Tj T*
(manufacturers of Berkshire County, for example, who may doubtless be) Tj T*
