() Tj T*
(On the other hand, all this is not _business_. All this is contrary to) Tj T*
(the very old, and the very good adage, that it takes _two_ to make a) Tj T*
(bargain. If we express this adage in the language of our science, it) Tj T*
(will take some such form as this: When two men have mutual services to) Tj T*
(exchange, let them come to a fair agreement as to the terms on which) Tj T*
(they will exchange. Certainly, let each make the best terms he can,) Tj T*
(but let the bargain always be free. If one party, who happens to have) Tj T*
(the power to do it, uses anything like compulsion upon the other, it) Tj T*
(ceases so far forth to be a bargain at all, and becomes a sort of) Tj T*
(robbery, of which in some cases courts will take cognizance. Now,) Tj T*
(workmen bring a certain valuable service to the market, just such a) Tj T*
(service as the capitalist wants, and he has to offer just such a) Tj T*
(service as they want, namely, wages: let the two parties come to a) Tj T*
(free and fair agreement on the terms of their exchange; let each) Tj T*
(workman by all means make the very best terms he can, insisting to the) Tj T*
(last penny on all he can get elsewhere, for the value of his service) Tj T*
(is determined, as other values are determined, by what it will bring:) Tj T*
(let the employer do just the same on his side, and so let a fair) Tj T*
(bargain for the time present be struck. This is a very good kind of) Tj T*
(_striking_, and the more intelligence and skill and self-respect a) Tj T*
(workman has, the better prepared he is to strike the bargain and) Tj T*
(secure his just due by and for himself alone; and this gives a good) Tj T*
(chance for every man who has any peculiar gift, who may have surpassed) Tj T*
(his fellows in diligence and skill, to secure a proportionate reward) Tj T*
(now and to go on higher in future; all this gives opportunity for) Tj T*
(_diversity of relative advantage_, which, as we have seen, lies at the) Tj T*
(basis of all exchange, which itself starts in individualism and) Tj T*
(naturally proceeds in a still higher individualism to the end. This is) Tj T*
(the only way for a laborer of talent and diligence to secure fully) Tj T*
(what belongs to _him_ as a man and a workman. If he cannot get from a) Tj T*
(given employer what he thinks he ought to get, what he thinks the) Tj T*
(service is worth in another market, let him exercise his perfect right) Tj T*
(to quit and go elsewhere. All this is fair and aboveboard and) Tj T*
(individual and progressive.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Everybody knows that there is a kind of _striking_ now in vogue wholly) Tj T*
