(The above is the universal and fundamental objection to Strikes. _The) Tj T*
(remedy for economical evils, real or supposed, must ever be found in) Tj T*
(economical considerations._ The strong but foolish tendency of the) Tj T*
(times is to mix up things that are quite distinct; to try to apply to) Tj T*
