(this, namely, that certain laborers within given classes combine of) Tj T*
(their own accord, \(1\) _either to purchase their necessaries in common) Tj T*
(and at wholesale, hence at cheaper rates because avoiding all profits) Tj T*
(of the middlemen_; or \(2\), _more especially to engage in the joint) Tj T*
(production of the commodities they are familiar with, the laborers) Tj T*
(furnishing the capital also from their little hoards or borrowing it) Tj T*
(on the strength of their individual or associated credit, managing the) Tj T*
(business themselves, all being co-partners, and of course all sharing) Tj T*
(pro rata the entire profits of the concern_.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(All this is well; and in countries where laborers have been under) Tj T*
(traditional disabilities, it may be in some cases very promotive of) Tj T*
(their self-respect, activity, frugality, and general welfare; but any) Tj T*
(one can see that no new economic principle is involved in the plan. As) Tj T*
(in all other production, so here, there must be \(1\) capital from some) Tj T*
(source, \(2\) steady and skilful labor, and \(3\) superintendence or) Tj T*
(management of the business. It is at the third point that schemes of) Tj T*
(co-operation have mostly broken down. The faculty of good management) Tj T*
