(in just such sums as they need. They have ultimately to pay for no) Tj T*
(more credit than they actually use, because the drawer will pay back) Tj T*
(to the payee, in case he has bought and paid for the entire credit) Tj T*
(drawn, the cash difference; while on the other hand, arrangements can) Tj T*
