(of which it was subjected in 1883. It has grown in size, in symmetry) Tj T*
(and in maturity of thought and expression, so that it is a complete) Tj T*
(exposition of the science, both historically and topically. The) Tj T*
(distinctive feature of the work is its discarding the term _Wealth_) Tj T*
